## Core Framework (`Okay/`)

### `Okay/Core/` - Framework Core
- **`Adapters/`** (21 *.php): Adapter pattern implementations
- **`Classes/`** (2 *.php): Core utility classes
- **`config/`**: Core configuration files
  - `container.php`: Dependency injection container setup
  - `routes.php`: Route definitions
  - `services.php`: Service definitions
  - `constants.php`: System constants
  - `functions.php`: Global functions
  - `helpers.php`: Helper functions
  - `parameters.php`: System parameters
  - `requests.php`: Request configuration
- **`Console/`** (18 files): CLI commands (Symfony Console)
- **`DebugBar/`** (4 files): Debug toolbar integration
- **`Entity/`** (11 *.php): Base entity classes
- **`Modules/`** (26 *.php): Module system core
- **`OkayContainer/`** (9 *.php): Dependency injection container
- **`QueryFactory/`** (6 *.php): Query builder factory
- **`Routes/`** (37 *.php): Route handler classes
- **`Scheduler/`** (3 *.php): Cron scheduler system
- **`SmartyPlugins/`**: Custom Smarty plugins
- **`TemplateConfig/`**: Template configuration classes
- **`TplMod/`**: Template modifier system (parser, nodes)
- **`UserReferer/`**: User referer tracking

